OSVplat patch for LichtFeld-Studio 09d33818 (v0.5.4; applied by scripts/setup_lichtfeld.sh).
Intended for upstream; drop it once LichtFeld has the flag.

--opacity-reg: the opacity regularizer weight (opacity_reg), a Float binding
like --max-screen-share, recorded as an explicit override like every other
optimisation flag. Otherwise it can only be set through --config, which
replaces the whole optimisation parameter set. The flag changes nothing unless
given.

Why: LichtFeld #3124 set MRNF's opacity_reg from 0.003 to 0, measuring
24.92 -> 25.73 dB PSNR on a 7,494-view capture where each surface is seen from
few cameras, and a small loss on compact scenes. --opacity-reg 0.003 trains
this build with the previous default, to tell that change apart from the rest
of the v0.5.4 MRNF retune on OSVplat's own clips.

